{"id": "61874", "title": "如若有你，一生何求", "author": "锦竹", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 22, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/61/61874.htm", "intro": "叶一生是那种不自信的女人，她爱的人太优秀，她不敢去追求。当优秀的第三者出现，她只会懦弱地让出。可总会有那么一种优秀的男人，万花丛中片叶不沾，只执着于一个女人。很庆幸，叶一生遇见这样的男人。她要的太少，他却爱得太深。\r\n 【简介】第一次，她吃了他，她跑了；第二次他吃了她，去民政局了。\r\n ???????场景??????????\r\n “医生，一生何求？”\r\n 一生娇滴滴地道：“跟着宋安辰走，有肉吃~”\r\n 一脚踹飞，“我问的是宋医生。”\r\n “脱光她的衣服，换上婚纱。”\r\n 一生可怜兮兮地哭诉：“你脱了两次。”\r\n “……”\r\n （高干正剧，肿瘤外科医生竹马与小护士青梅的重逢后爱……）\r\n \r\n 我的古言完结文朋友的文：\r\n 我的新文：一定要看啊~~~~~~\r\n 此文已出版，当当、卓越、京东都有售。", "base": "files/article/html/61/61874", "chapters": [{"title": "Chapter.1", "file": "9149402.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter.2", "file": "9149404.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter.3", "file": "9149406.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter.4", "file": "9149407.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter.5", "file": "9149408.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter.6", "file": "9149409.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter.7", "file": "9149410.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter.8", "file": "9149412.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter.9", "file": "9149416.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter.10", "file": "9149417.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter.11", "file": "9149419.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter.12", "file": "9149422.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter.13", "file": "9149423.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter.14", "file": "9149425.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter.15", "file": "9149427.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter.16", "file": "9149430.html", "available": false}, {"title": "17-21", "file": "9149431.html", "available": false}, {"title": "22-26", "file": "9149432.html", "available": false}, {"title": "27-30", "file": "9149433.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "9149434.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "